  "description": "Not quite ready to go pro? The Race Lite Pro is almost fully grown up with a tried & true 20.75\" top tube length. Add a durable chromoly fork to take the landings, 8\" rise chromoly bars, 170mm forged cranks and pro-sized 20 X 1.75\" rims mounted with a 1.95\" front and 1.75\" Konversion tires, and you have yourself a race-ready BMX machine. The Race Lite Pro model shares many of the same key components and spec as the Expert XL model but have been sized up slightly. 20.75\" top tube frame, 175mm cranks, 8\" rise bars and wider rims/tires all contribute to making this platform fit the needs of racers who have grown beyond the Expert XL size.\n6061-T6 Heat Treated Alloy Frame w/ Integrated Headtube, Internal Cable Routing, Smooth Welding & Haro 3D Dropouts w/ Integrated Chain Tensioner\nFull chromoly 1 1/8\" Threadless Steerer w/ Tapered Legs\n2-pc Forged Alloy w/ 24mm Hollow Spindle\n20\" Alloy 36h, Double Wall\n36h Alloy Sealed-Bearing w/Disc 16T Cassette Rear\nKenda \"Konversion\" 20 x 1.95\" Front / 20 x 1.75\" Rear",
